    "summary": "A cotton kerchief, used for interior decoration.  Made from natural coloured weft faced tabby woven cotton.  In the centre are alternating red and blue (alternately green) bands (two fine bands close together).  Each warp end has a wide, multicoloured, predominantly orange woven border.  This is broken up with thin yellow bands and &#039;x&#039; motifs, worked in white, green and yellow cotton, and pink, green, blue and lilac woollen yarns.  The warp ends are turned and machine stitched.",
